    "references": [
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 0",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 0,
          "component_id": "f977cc96-1599-512c-b380-a58246283980",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 340,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) Purpose. For the purpose of promoting the public health, safety and welfare, it is hereby declared to be in the public interest to enact a means for recovery, through civil suit if required, of the recoverable expenses incurred in taking an emergency action to save life, prevent suffering or disability or to protect and save property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "656119b5-b354-5574-bbda-531ef51721a4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 382,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:1",
          "start": 341
        },
        "quote": "(b) Definitions. As used in this section:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "18eaf4b3-81a6-50ed-a68c-0f40c788ac15",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 603,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:2",
          "start": 383
        },
        "quote": "“Emergency action” means all of the activities conducted in order to prevent or mitigate injury to human health or the environment from a release or threatened release of hazardous materials into or upon the environment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "f2924654-55eb-5c12-9b69-bd06f1feb4f6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1053,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:3",
          "start": 604
        },
        "quote": "“Hazardous materials” means waste, or a combination of wastes, chemicals, or substances which, because of their quantity, concentration, or physical, chemical, biological, or infectious characteristics, cause or significantly contribute to an increase in mortality or serious personal injury; or pose a substantial present or potential hazard to human health or the environment when improperly treated, stored, transported, disposed of, or released.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "f656aac4-d8b4-5c83-ae46-fe4763538aaa",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1176,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:4",
          "start": 1054
        },
        "quote": "“Person” means and includes any individual, corporation, association, partnership, firm, trustee, or legal representative.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "748caf4c-8bc0-5dc0-ab29-0d2a58f54dd4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1555,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:5",
          "start": 1177
        },
        "quote": "“Recoverable expenses” means those expenses that are reasonable, necessary and allocable to the emergency action. “Recoverable expenses” shall not include normal expenditures that are incurred in the course of providing what are traditionally local services and responsibilities, such as routine firefighting. Expenses allowable for recovery may include, but are not limited to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "67f95198-760d-5959-b570-2a7be8a173cd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1651,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:6",
          "start": 1556
        },
        "quote": "(1) Disposable materials and supplies acquired, consumed and expended for the emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "30fbe5fd-ecf3-5711-8f44-c06e8f32a69a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1752,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:7",
          "start": 1652
        },
        "quote": "(2) Compensation of employees for the time and efforts devoted specifically to the emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "393593d0-0301-57b3-b03f-56b9bd0d18e2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1895,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:8",
          "start": 1753
        },
        "quote": "(3) Rental or leasing of equipment used for the emergency action (e.g., protective equipment or clothing, scientific and technical equipment).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "e65c27d9-48f5-5111-97f8-3b0539e8a877",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1989,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:9",
          "start": 1896
        },
        "quote": "(4) Replacement, repair and/or cleaning costs for equipment utilized in the emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "c96ac301-c888-5585-8d77-e3375faf878e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2187,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:10",
          "start": 1990
        },
        "quote": "(5) Special technical services utilized in the response (e.g., costs associated with the time and efforts of technical experts or specialists not otherwise provided for by the governmental entity).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "36bb2d78-edf2-5839-8cd2-746bc69c35f4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2248,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:11",
          "start": 2188
        },
        "quote": "(6) Other special services utilized in the emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "550d14a7-8238-5c82-905e-c051ec3c1d19",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2338,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:12",
          "start": 2249
        },
        "quote": "(7) Laboratory costs for purposes of analyzing samples taken during the emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "597c68aa-bf29-5480-9a52-6e32362c8140",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2410,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:13",
          "start": 2339
        },
        "quote": "(8) Any costs of cleanup, storage or disposal of the released material.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "2259be8a-2963-5af2-b7fc-18ca80cbb354",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2501,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:14",
          "start": 2411
        },
        "quote": "(9) Costs associated with the services, supplies and equipment procured for an evacuation.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "481a34a8-057d-518c-bc8a-7a390269ec2a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2568,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:15",
          "start": 2502
        },
        "quote": "(10) Medical expenses incurred as a result of response activities.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "56da7517-84e3-529f-a47f-dd1fa5e3cc8b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2710,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:16",
          "start": 2569
        },
        "quote": "(11) Legal expenses that may be incurred as a result of the emergency action, including efforts to recover expenses pursuant to this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "cd331aa8-c59b-5e9d-866d-f3451efcb1a1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2882,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:17",
          "start": 2711
        },
        "quote": "“Release” means any spilling, leaking, pumping, pouring, emitting, emptying, discharging, injecting, escaping, leaching, dumping or disposing into or upon the environment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "217c6fbb-d076-54d9-a3da-4ae4879844d7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3003,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:18",
          "start": 2883
        },
        "quote": "“Threatened release” means any imminent, impending, or potential release which causes the City to take emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "e13f1c76-a5a0-551f-92d5-075b26603d2b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3169,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:19",
          "start": 3004
        },
        "quote": "(c) Liability. The following persons shall be jointly and severally liable to the City for the recoverable expenses incurred by the City during the emergency action:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "a30a1042-4533-5f40-8af9-0586258d09af",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3339,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:20",
          "start": 3170
        },
        "quote": "(1) The person or persons whose willful or negligent acts, or omission thereof, were the proximate cause of the release or threatened release of any hazardous materials,",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "fd12250f-d0f5-5033-9288-da6bf5b56251",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3528,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:21",
          "start": 3340
        },
        "quote": "(2) The person or persons who owned, controlled, or were in custody of the hazardous materials at the time of the release or threatened release, with no regard to fault or proximate cause,",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "b9d2ddbf-37fd-5184-87ff-f1e994cd2543",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3782,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:22",
          "start": 3529
        },
        "quote": "(3) The person or persons who owned, controlled, or were in custody of the container which held the hazardous materials released, or threatened to be released, at the time of the release or threatened release, with no regard to fault or proximate cause.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "355dca23-4564-56f8-9ea1-fba6880d9204",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3807,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:23",
          "start": 3783
        },
        "quote": "(d) Recovery of Expense.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "77a2bee4-8e7b-5686-8897-7246639f6e79",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4214,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:24",
          "start": 3808
        },
        "quote": "(1) Each department involved in an emergency action shall keep a detailed record of its recoverable expenses resulting from the emergency action then, promptly after completion of the emergency action, certify any such recoverable expenses to the appropriate legal counsel with a corresponding request that the recovery process be initiated against any and all persons responsible for the emergency action.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "b9528ab8-a96c-5913-b65e-341b3b75f419",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4736,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:25",
          "start": 4215
        },
        "quote": "(2) Not less than 30 days before filing a civil action, legal counsel shall submit a written, itemized claim for the total certified expenses incurred by the City responding to the emergency action to the responsible party with a written notice that unless the amounts are paid in full to the City within 30 days after the date of the mailing of the claim and notice, legal counsel will file a civil action for the stated amount. Moneys recovered under this section shall be credited to the appropriate funds of the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "163d55d5-141a-507f-8423-831e930b70dd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4876,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:26",
          "start": 4737
        },
        "quote": "(e) Conflicting Ordinances. Any other resolution or ordinance in conflict with this section is hereby repealed. (Ord. 20216 § 2, 10-15-19.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.55.020 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "abd9cd0b-6113-55ae-ac17-18afa7269fa5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5015,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:27",
          "start": 4877
        },
        "quote": "State Law References: Immunity from liability for assisting in cleanup of hazardous waste spills, discharges, etc., K.S.A. 65-3471 et seq.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.55.020:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
